l4: $ G ⇒ isset (nmul a b) $ by nmul_set
k1: $ G , w = nmul a b ⇒ isset (nadd w a) $ by nadd_set
k2: $ G , w = nmul a b ⇒ fv (cgr x (nadd x a)) w = nadd w a $ by fv_cgr [k1]
k3: $ G , w = nmul a b ⇒ w = nmul a b $ by ax
